@startuml
start
:Hello world;
:This is defined on
several **lines**;
if (Graphviz installed?) then (yes)
  :process all\ndiagrams;
else (no)
  :process only
  __sequence__ and __activity__ diagrams;
endif
while (data available?)
  :read data;
endwhile
fork
  :action 1;
fork again
  :action 2;
end fork
stop
@enduml
